# P-MSEL: SelectNextMode (FT listing 2063-2108) through the real caller, a mode end. A running mode 7 is
# forced like the original's `info_text_box+6` write (poke) and ended by its mode timer; ModeEnd (MissionControlSwitch, modes 4-11)
# adds the 750,000 jackpot, lights the mode's light off and calls SelectNextMode, which draws from the one rand stream
# (init seed 1: the selection repeats run to run, checked by the a=b compare of two runs).
# Not covered here: "set at mode 2 entry" (needs Mode2IdleController) and "cleared by a drain" (needs BallDrainControl). The value 4 is
# the measured draw with seed 1 (characterization,
# not recomputed from the listing's draw model); the range check 1..8 is the behaviour (index of the eight selectable modes).
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 10
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
199 expect selected_mode == 0
200 poke info_text_box message_field 7
201 event info_text_box ControlMissionComplete
250 expect selected_mode == 0
251 event mode_timer ControlTimerExpired
252 expect mode == 2
252 expect selected_mode in 1 8
252 expect selected_mode == 4
252 expect jackpot == 1750000
300 quit
